.TH CSTR_CONSTRUCT_MP 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_construct_mp \- declare and initialise a cstr with custom memory management
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cstring.h>

cstr_construct_mp(s, initial, mprocs);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Combines cstr_declare() and cstr_init_mp() into a single statement. Creates
a cstr using the supplied custom memory management procedures.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s        Variable name to create
initial  Initial content (C string or NULL for empty string)
mprocs   Custom memory management procedures (ccol_memmgmt_procs_t *)
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstr_construct (3),
.BR cstr_construct_mp_scoped (3),
.BR cstr_init_mp (3)
